The '''VCX-series''' was a line of [[freighter]]s produced by the [[Corellian Engineering Corporation]]. Models in the line included the [[VCX-100 light freighter]]<ref name="MFOM" /> and the [[VCX-series auxiliary starfighter]].<ref name="USW" />

